{"id":"413959","name":"娃娃菜松花汤","author":"尔东叶","authorId":"6100832","desc":"","cover":"images/413959/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"松花","amount":"2个"},{"name":"娃娃菜","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"粉丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"粉丝用冷水浸泡30分钟。2、3、4、5、煮锅加水，粉丝入锅煮。","img":"images/413959/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"松花入蒸锅蒸20分钟。蒸后的松花再煮汤不会散。","img":"images/413959/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"娃娃菜洗干净回刀。","img":"images/413959/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒸好的松花去壳。","img":"images/413959/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切成块。","img":"images/413959/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮锅加水，粉丝入锅煮。","img":"images/413959/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"开锅后娃娃菜头入锅煮。","img":"images/413959/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再开锅后娃娃菜尾入锅煮。","img":"images/413959/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再开锅后松花入锅煮。","img":"images/413959/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"、再开锅后加盐、味精。","img":"images/413959/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅拌均匀关火，将枸杞入锅。","img":"images/413959/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盛出即可享用。","img":"images/413959/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"松花先蒸再入汤或是入菜都不会散。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}